msgstr "etiquetas simples en estilo XML"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:917
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, useCommonRules)
#: rc.cpp:713
msgid "Append common parsing rules"
msgstr "Adicionar regras de análise comúns"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:925
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, useCommonRules)
#: rc.cpp:716
msgid ""
"Check it to append common parsing rules. These are:\n"
"<p><b>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;SpecialAreas=&lt;?xml ?&gt;, &lt;!-- --&gt;, &lt;! &gt;\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;SpecialAreaNames = XML PI, comment, DTD\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;Comments = &lt;!-- --&gt;\n"
"</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar para adicionar regras de análise comúns. Estas son:\n"
"<p><b>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;ÁreasEspeciais=&lt;?xml ?&gt;, &lt;!--·--&gt;, &lt;! &gt;\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;NomesÁreasEspeciais = XML PI, comentario, DTD\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;Comentario = &lt;!--·--&gt;\n"
"</b></p>"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:928
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, useCommonRules)
#: rc.cpp:724
msgid "Use common rules"
msgstr "Utilizar regras comúns"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:938
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, extendedBooleans)
#: rc.cpp:727
msgid "Check if the booleans are stored in extended form"
msgstr "Sinalar se as booleanas se armacenan na forma extendida"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:946
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, extendedBooleans)
#: rc.cpp:730
msgid ""
"Check if you want extended booleans in the language.<br>\n"
"Examples:<br>\n"
"<i>Simple boolean</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr&gt;</b><br>\n"
"<i>Extended boolean</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"1\"&gt;</b> or <b>&lt;"
"tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"true\"&gt;</b>.\n"
"<br>\n"
"See the <b>True</b> and <b>False</b> boxes to define the values for true and "
"false."
msgstr ""
"Sinale esta opción se quer booleanas extendidas na linguaxe.<br>\n"
"Exemplos:<br>\n"
"<i>Booleana simple</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanaAtrib&gt;</b><br>\n"
"<i>Booleana extendida</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanaAtrib=\"1\"&gt;</"
"b>·ou<b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanaAtrib=\"true\"&gt;</b>.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Vexa as caixas de <b>Verdadeiro</b> e <b>Falso</b>para definir os valores de "
"verdadeiro e falso."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:949
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, extendedBooleans)
#: rc.cpp:738
msgid "Extended booleans"
msgstr "Booleanas extendidas"

